, estructuras y usos distintos.","audience":"free","comments_enabled":true,"comments_state":"default","enforce_gated_content":true,"enable_popup_on_scroll":false,"email_capture_title":"Suscríbete para seguir leyendo","email_capture_message":"Este contenido es gratuito, pero debes estar suscrito a Tellus Cooperative para continuar leyendo.","email_capture_cta":"Suscríbete","estimated_reading_time":2,"estimated_reading_time_display":"2 minutos","paywall_id":null,"authors":[{"id":"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12","name":"Pau Koh","profile_picture":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/pau_headshot_1.png","thumb":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/thumb_pau_headshot_1.png"},"landscape":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/landscape_pau_headshot_1.png"}},"bio":"𝘊𝘔𝘎𝘙/𝘛𝘦𝘭𝘭𝘶𝘴 𝘊𝘰𝘰𝘱𝘦𝘳𝘢𝘵𝘪𝘷𝘦","twitter_handle":"kl0ren","facebook_url":null,"instagram_url":null,"linkedin_url":null,"tiktok_url":null,"youtube_url":null,"discord_url":null,"bluesky_url":null}],"content_tags":[{"id":"89c8fef5-1da9-4d08-b488-2fc2c71796bf","display":"Educación","slug":"educacion"}],"created_at":"2025-06-02T21:22:54Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T13:01:52Z","html":null,"hide_premium_post":false,"contains_subscriber_break":false,"is_accessible_for_free":true,"paywall_shown":false,"metered_usage_shown":false,"metered_viewed_count":null,"force_premium":false,"enforce_paywall_breaks":true,"display_thumbnail_on_web":true,"display_title_on_web":true,"display_subtitle_on_web":true,"author_urls":{"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12":"https://blog.telluscoop.com/authors/pau-koh"},"custom_structured_data":null},"body":"<div class=\"_10pdwo80 dream-post-content-doc\"><div id=\"1-qu-es-una-base-de-datos\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">1. ¿Qué es una base de datos?</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Una </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>base de datos</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> es un sistema que permite </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>almacenar, organizar y acceder a información</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> de forma eficiente. Es utilizada en casi todas las aplicaciones digitales modernas: desde bancos hasta redes sociales.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Las bases de datos tradicionales son:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Centralizadas</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: controladas por una única entidad.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Editables</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: los datos pueden modificarse o eliminarse.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Rápidas</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: están optimizadas para velocidad y rendimiento.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"2-qu-es-una-blockchain\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">2. ¿Qué es una blockchain?</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Una </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>blockchain</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> es una red de nodos que registra datos en bloques enlazados de forma </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>inmutable y cronológica</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">. No hay un único dueño: todos los participantes verifican y acuerdan cada nuevo bloque.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Las blockchains se caracterizan por:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Descentralización</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: no hay un único punto de control.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Transparencia</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: cualquier persona puede ver los registros (en redes públicas).</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Inmutabilidad</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: los datos no se pueden editar ni borrar.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Confianza sin intermediarios</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: se basa en reglas automáticas y consenso.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"3-diferencias-clave\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">3. Diferencias clave</span></h2></div><div class=\"b7oqx90\" style=\"--cell-width:14.285714285714286%\"><table class=\"b7oqx91\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"_200kro0\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Característica</span></p></div></th><th class=\"_200kro0\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Base de datos tradicional</span></p></div></th><th class=\"_200kro0\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Blockchain</span></p></div></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Control</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Centralizado</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Descentralizado</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Edición de datos</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Permitida</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">No permitida</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Seguridad</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Interna</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Criptográfica y distribuida</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Transparencia</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Limitada</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Alta (en blockchains públicas)</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Velocidad</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Alta</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Menor (por consenso)</span></p></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Casos de uso</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Empresas, sitios web</span></p></div></td><td class=\"ox1r470\" valign=\"top\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Cripto, trazabilidad, contratos inteligentes</span></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div id=\"entonces-cul-usar\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h2 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx3\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Entonces, ¿cuál usar?</span></h2></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">No se trata de que una reemplace a la otra. </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>La blockchain no es “mejor” que una base de datos</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, simplemente </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>sirve para cosas distintas</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si necesitas velocidad y control interno: usa una base de datos.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si necesitas transparencia, resistencia a la censura y confianza sin intermediarios: usa una blockchain.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"_7pt7ks0\"><div class=\"_7pt7ks1\"></div></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">En </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Nuestra Cooperativa</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, promovemos el uso de la blockchain como una herramienta para construir sistemas más justos, auditables y colaborativos. 🔍 También apoyamos el desarrollo de tecnologías que conectan blockchains con otras bases de datos y servicios, como los </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>metabuscadores</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, para hacer este mundo más accesible.</span></p></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Quieres descubrir cómo esta tecnología puede transformar tu comunidad? En nuestra cooperativa te lo explicamos paso a paso.</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/2SHteza5dJ\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-lay